SUMMARY:Opening Reception: The Many Unheard Voices
DESCRIPTION:The Many Unheard Voices: The African American Communities of Gaston County\, 1870s-1970s is a community curated exhibit funded by the NC Humanities and NEH. The exhibit explores the African American communities Gaston County through the lens of education\, community\, and inspiration. Oral histories and local objects\, resources\, and conversations are the heart of the exhibit to include as many voices as possible. The opening reception is 1a-4pm on Saturday\, July 18\, 2026. Explore the robust communities of Gaston County\, listen\, and leave your mark.
URL:https://nchumanities.org/event/opening-reception-the-many-unheard-voices/
LOCATION:Gaston County Museum of Art & History\, 131 W Main Street\, Dallas\, NC\, 28034-2021\, United States
CATEGORIES:NC Humanities Grantee Event
ORGANIZER;CN="Gaston County Museum of Art &amp%3B History":MAILTO:alicyn.wiedrich@gastongov.com
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:NC Humanities Council
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260718T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260718T160000
DTSTAMP:20260615T010150
CREATED:20250625T133515Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20250625T133515Z
UID:10001074-1784379600-1784390400@nchumanities.org
SUMMARY:PUBLIC OPENING: Community Curated Exhibit "The Many Unheard Voices"
DESCRIPTION:You’re invited to attend the public opening of our community curated exhibit: The Many Unheard Voices. This exhibit tells the stories of the African American communities of Gaston County. Many of this stories have been left out of the narrative or haven’t been fully explored. We are proud to work with a variety of community members to tell an enriched story of our African American Communities.
URL:https://nchumanities.org/event/public-opening-community-curated-exhibit-the-many-unheard-voices/
LOCATION:Gaston County Museum of Art & History\, 131 W Main Street\, Dallas\, NC\, 28034-2021\, United States
CATEGORIES:NC Humanities Grantee Event
ORGANIZER;CN="Gaston County Museum of Art &amp%3B History":MAILTO:alicyn.wiedrich@gastongov.com
END:VEVENT
